.TH OLLAMA_COMPAT 1 "2026-06-29" "Symoneural" "Symoneural Helper Utilities"
.SH NAME
ollama_compat \- Ollama Modelfile generator and REST API wrappers
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B python helpers/python/ollama_compat.py
.RB [ \-\-base\-url
.IR URL ]
.I COMMAND
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ollama_compat.py
provides CLI commands to generate Ollama Modelfiles from local GGUF paths,
list models, pull models from the registry, and delete models.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B modelfile \fIgguf\fR [\-\-out \fIPATH\fR] [\-\-system \fITEXT\fR] [\-\-temperature \fIFLOAT\fR]
Generate (and optionally write) an Ollama Modelfile for the GGUF at
.IR gguf .
If
.B \-\-out
is omitted, the Modelfile is printed to stdout.
.TP
.B list
Print the names of all models currently available in the Ollama instance.
.TP
.B pull \fINAME\fR
Pull model
.I NAME
from the Ollama registry (e.g.
.BR llama3:8b ).
.TP
.B delete \fINAME\fR
Delete model
.I NAME
from the local Ollama instance.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-base\-url \fIURL\fR
Ollama instance base URL (default:
.BR http://localhost:11434 ).
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Generate a Modelfile to stdout:
.RS
.EX
python helpers/python/ollama_compat.py modelfile path/to/model.gguf \-\-system "You are helpful."
.EE
.RE
.PP
Write Modelfile with temperature:
.RS
.EX
python helpers/python/ollama_compat.py modelfile path/to/model.gguf \-\-out Modelfile \-\-temperature 0.7
.EE
.RE
.PP
List loaded models:
.RS
.EX
python helpers/python/ollama_compat.py list
.EE
.RE
.PP
Pull llama3:
.RS
.EX
python helpers/python/ollama_compat.py pull llama3:8b
.EE
.RE
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B OLLAMA_BASE_URL
Overrides the default Ollama base URL when used as a library.
.SH DEPENDENCIES
.B httpx
(pip install httpx).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR gguf_inspect (1)
.SH AUTHORS
Symoneural contributors.
